  id: note_3
  title: "Note from the chest"
  description: "The last note in Room B, signed J.H."
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3189e4a0e0a7eb91a1d729df07a2ffeb, type: 3}
  kind: 3
  amount: 0
  text: "Last one in this room.\n\nI set the door to the time I signed in for my final shift. I always sign in by the door. Check the sheet, the most recent night.\n\nType it the way the clock shows it: four numbers, no colon.\n\nLock up behind you. I'll be next door.\n\n\u2014 J.H."
